<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro will make the tamer character move in a square path. The character will move the distance of 1 sec in a loop of 3 times and stop to do an attack sequencs of 3 times and then heal. This will repeat an x amount of time. Make sure that you have a Magnet ID attached so items can be picked up automatically.

The moving aspect of this macro is so that you can move from one group of digimon to another,without having to wait until the same group spawns before attacking again and it will minize other players from seeing your character as a BOT.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
